<title>USA: American Phoenix to buy Teterless Access.</title>
<headline>American Phoenix to buy Teterless Access.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Phoenix Group Inc said on Tuesday that it signed a letter of intent to acquire Teterless Access Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, American Phoenix Group would purchase all of Teterless Access Asia's capital stock in exchange for a combination of American Phoenix common stock, preferred stock and options.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
